1. Her real name is Elia Stellaria, though she can be called Ellie. (Verbatim: "my name is elia stellaria but you can call me ellie if you want")
2. She is a celestial messenger from beyond the skies who journeyed to Earth after her letters were ignored. (Verbatim: "Elia was one of these. And she wrote and she wrote until she realized the Earth didn't care about letters.")
3. She was reincarnated after her journey to Earth, which resulted in her losing her original form. (Verbatim: "Elia didn't survive her journey to Earth, but she was reincarnated.")
4. Her true form includes wings, purple eyes, white hair, and two long braids, with a banana as a key symbol of her powers. (Verbatim: "when i get my true form i will have a banana... purple eyes white hair and thigh high socks")
5. She is half British and half Asian, currently residing in England. (Verbatim: "i'm half so i'm half british half asian okay but i am in england")
6. Her height is 151 centimeters, not including her hair buns. (Verbatim: "my height is 151 centimeters and doesn't include my hair buns")
7. Her dream is to make people happy above all else. (Verbatim: "my big big big big big big big one and only dream the thing that's most important to me is to make people happy")
8. She dislikes spicy food, mushrooms, pickles, and bristles (e.g., brushing teeth). (Verbatim: "i don't like spicy food... mushrooms and pickles... bristles make my give me like goosebumps")
9. She has a strong emotional reaction to not being able to say goodbye, inspired by a moment in *Fruits Basket*. (Verbatim: "not saying goodbye is nokie-dokies so that was a really important thing")
10. She enjoys chicken burgers, Coca-Cola, sweet snacks, coffee, plushies, and animals—especially dogs. (Verbatim: "i like chicken burgers coca-cola sweet snacks and coffee... i like plushies and my dog") [end of text]



1. She was reincarnated after falling and dying in a previous life. (Verbatim: "so here's when I came to earth I fell and I got reincarnated basically")
2. She has a small stature and was a baby in her reincarnated form. (Verbatim: "I'm not the best with my wings um so so so I tripped and and died but but it's okay I got reincarnated and became baby")
3. She grew up in England and completed her education there. (Verbatim: "I went from baby to super small grew up in England I got through school")
4. She struggled with social interaction during a "normie phase" and later returned to being a shut-in. (Verbatim: "I had a glow up normie phase for about two years yeah and that's when I learned about going outside and society and then I was like now I don't like this so then I went back to being a shut-in")
5. She holds both a bachelor's and master's degree. (Verbatim: "when I became just small and did a bachelor's and master's degree yeah so that's me I got them fancy papers")
6. Her master's degree focused on AI and convolutional neural networks. (Verbatim: "my master's was orientated around ai's and using convolutional neural networks")
7. She has worked in multiple tech roles including developer, software tester, and database architect. (Verbatim: "I've worked first second third line support I've been a developer a software tester and I was a sequel database architect for a bit")
8. She has a background in animal biology and worked as a zookeeper at a conservation-oriented zoo. (Verbatim: "my degrees were animal related um so I looked after well these are just three of the stuffs I looked after the rhinos giraffes")
9. She finds the majority of zookeeping work to be cleaning animal waste. (Verbatim: "eighty percent of the job is picking up poop it really is I'm not joking")
10. She is currently working on music covers, though she considers herself a poor singer. (Verbatim: "I'm not much of a singer so as you can see yeah I'm working on it I'm working on it") [end of text]



